          "basis": "Read from the source at both commits and at Spring Framework v5.2.0.RC2 (HttpStatus.java blob 466ad8dd, the same blob as v5.2.0.RELEASE), the version both commits pin. An unwinding the check can't complete leaves the attempt unresolved, never established."
