          },
          "description": "Outcome.forStatus's first range takes 200 too (status <= 200), so WebMvcTags.outcome labels a 200 response INFORMATIONAL instead of SUCCESS. It breaks preservation at status 200 and only there; the label stays in the finite set, so the finite-outcome property holds on the mutant by design."
        },
